### Sign up with Email

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nick Olson",
  "email": "nickolsoncodes@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Missing Email throws error

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nick Olson",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Missing Password throws error
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nick Olson",
  "email": "test@test.com"
}

### Sign in with Email and Password
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nickolsoncodes@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### forgot password
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/forget-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nickolsoncodes@gmail.com"
}

### Reset Password
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "newpassword123",
  "token": "lM6gKNIilAG4CLzac7dPx41o"
}

### Get todos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/todos

### Create a new todo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "another New Todo",
  "description": "This is a new todo"
}